  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A grooming salon in the very centre of Cavalaire-sur-Mer since 1994, handy for a freshen-up before or after a day at the beach. The salon offers full grooming as well as a selection of accessories for dogs and cats, with good reviews: 4.6/5 on Google (61 reviews), where customers mention the welcome, the professionalism and the need to book in advance, as the salon is in high demand.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon is closed at the weekend — remember to book your slot during the week, especially in the summer season when appointments go fast. A simple phone call is enough to book.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if you plan to go to the beach and then the groomer, allow plenty of time in summer — the salon closes at lunchtime like many shops in the area.</div>

      <h2>Services and shop</h2>
      <p>On its PagesJaunes page, updated by the salon itself, Au Chien Galant introduces itself this way: "The well-being of your pets is our priority. Our salon welcomes you during the week, with passion and skill." It provides careful dog grooming and has sold a wide choice of accessories for dogs and cats since 1994. The services listed are canine hygiene and aesthetics, scissor cutting, stripping and eye and ear cleaning; the shop also sells food, collars, leashes and clothing.</p>
      <p>The Grimaud tourist office, on its "My stay with my dog" page, lists the salon among the groomers of the Gulf of Saint-Tropez, with the number 06 82 92 64 31 and the address 77 avenue Charles de Gaulle in Cavalaire-sur-Mer. If you are staying in the gulf, it is an address the tourist office recommends when your dog needs a brush-up before or after the beach.</p>

      <h2>Worth checking before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon has no website of its own: hours and services come from its directory pages (PagesJaunes, Cylex), not from a salon website. Prices are not published. Hours given: Monday to Friday, 8:30am-12pm and 2:30-6pm; closed at the weekend. Phone: 06 82 92 64 31.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The salon is on avenue Charles de Gaulle, in the very centre of Cavalaire-sur-Mer, in the Les Régates building: a chance to do a bit of shopping in the centre while your dog gets pampered.</p>
